os Region. Is it really possible for all Pokémon to undergo Mega Evolution? This story revolves around a young trainer named Alan and his partner Lizadon (Charizard). Alan's objective on his journey is to \"defeat all Mega Evolution Pokémon and stand at the top of the strongest summit.\" Along their journey Alan and Charizard meet and battle with Mega Absol and Mega Gaburias (Mega Garchomp). Additionally, Alan will battle with Zumi (Siebold), one of the Kalos Elite Four. Does Siebold also have a Mega Evolution Pokémon? Why is Alan so obsessed with Mega Evolution? And what is the real purpose of his journey?\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Kids","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Proxy Battle","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Pokémon the Series: XY Mega Evolution Specials","english":"Pokémon the Series: XY Mega Evolution Specials","native":"ポケットモンスターXY MEGA EVOLUTION","romaji":"Pocket Monsters XY: MEGA EVOLUTION","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ポケットモンスターXY特別編 最強メガシンカ"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"宝可梦XY特别篇 最强超级进化"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"精灵宝可梦XY特别篇 最强Mega进化"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"神奇宝贝XY特别篇 最强Mega进化"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Pocket Monsters XY Special: The Strongest Mega Evolution"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Pocket Monsters XY Tokubetsu Hen: Saikyou Megashinka"}]},"trailer":{"id":"qnzdXEkKEtI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qnzdXEkKEtI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}